{"title": "Momentum_20D_Neutralized", "category": "自学习/agent生成", "formula": "", "description": "20日动量因子，剔除最近一日以避免未来函数，并做行业市值中性化处理。", "code": "import pandas as pd\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef alpha_factor(df: pd.DataFrame) -> pd.DataFrame:\n    # 计算20日动量（剔除最近一日）：过去20个交易日（不含当日）的累计收益率\n    df = df.sort_values(['symbol', 'date']).reset_index(drop=True)\n    # 计算日收益率\n    df['ret'] = df.groupby('symbol')['close'].pct_change()\n    # 计算20日累计收益率（t-20到t-1），shift(1)确保不含当日\n    df['factor_raw'] = df.groupby('symbol')['ret'].transform(lambda x: (1 + x).rolling(20, min_periods=20).apply(np.prod, raw=True) - 1)\n    df['factor_raw'] = df.groupby('symbol')['factor_raw'].shift(1)  # 再shift一次确保不含当日\n\n    # 行业市值中性化：假设df中已有行业列'sector'和市值列'market_cap'，若无则模拟\n    # 若缺少行业或市值列，则直接返回原始因子\n    if 'sector' not in df.columns or 'market_cap' not in df.columns:\n        df['factor'] = df['factor_raw'].fillna(0)\n        return df[['date', 'symbol', 'factor']]\n\n    # 对市值取对数\n    df['log_mkt_cap'] = np.log(df['market_cap'])\n\n    # 截面回归中性化：在每个日期，对每个行业，将因子对市值回归，取残差\n    def neutralize_group(group):\n        # 剔除缺失值\n        mask = group['factor_raw'].notna() & group['log_mkt_cap'].notna()\n        if mask.sum() < 3:  # 样本太少直接返回原始因子\n            group['factor'] = group['factor_raw'].fillna(0)\n            return group\n        x = group.loc[mask, 'log_mkt_cap'].values\n        y = group.loc[mask, 'factor_raw'].values\n        # 检查x是否近似常数\n        if np.std(x) < 1e-10:\n            group['factor'] = group['factor_raw'].fillna(0)\n            return group\n        # 添加截距项\n        A = np.vstack([x, np.ones_like(x)]).T\n        try:\n            coeff, _, _, _ = np.linalg.lstsq(A, y, rcond=None)\n            residuals = y - A @ coeff\n            group.loc[mask, 'factor'] = residuals\n        except:\n            group['factor'] = group['factor_raw'].fillna(0)\n        # 填充缺失值\n        group['factor'] = group['factor'].fillna(0)\n        return group\n\n    df = df.groupby(['date', 'sector'], group_keys=False).apply(neutralize_group)\n\n    # 最终因子做截面rank标准化到[0,1]\n    df['factor'] = df.groupby('date')['factor'].rank(pct=True).fillna(0)\n\n    return df[['date', 'symbol', 'factor']]", "source": "self_learned", "metrics": {"ic": 0.001938489887380272, "rank_ic": 0.002156130202047111, "icir": 0.016970721151709407, "ic_positive_ratio": 0.5120810600155885, "long_short_return": 0.011665505492141444, "long_short_sharpe": 44.17413030146057, "long_short_cum_return": 2868281.3872030675, "max_drawdown": 0.0, "annualized_volatility": 0.06652222698074578, "turnover": 0.07268938127680812, "coverage": 1.0, "n_stocks": 80, "n_dates": 1304, "quantile_cum": "{0: date\n2020-01-30    0.002282\n2020-01-31    0.008437\n2020-02-03    0.005294\n2020-02-04    0.004700\n2020-02-05    0.004421\n                ...   \n2024-12-24    1.124829\n2024-12-25    1.125103\n2024-12-26    1.120477\n2024-12-27    1.117228\n2024-12-30    1.130040\nName: 0.0, Length: 1283, dtype: float64, 1: date\n2020-01-30   -0.009411\n2020-01-31   -0.001562\n2020-02-03    0.001142\n2020-02-04   -0.002395\n2020-02-05    0.002188\n                ...   \n2024-12-24    0.823667\n2024-12-25    0.813557\n2024-12-26    0.836517\n2024-12-27    0.838617\n2024-12-30    0.825755\nName: 1.0, Length: 1283, dtype: float64, 2: date\n2020-01-30    0.007519\n2020-01-31    0.009012\n2020-02-03   -0.002593\n2020-02-04   -0.001820\n2020-02-05    0.007353\n                ...   \n2024-12-24    1.053010\n2024-12-25    1.067749\n2024-12-26    1.046508\n2024-12-27    1.050494\n2024-12-30    1.053037\nName: 2.0, Length: 1283, dtype: float64, 3: date\n2020-01-30   -0.001481\n2020-01-31    0.005955\n2020-02-03    0.004689\n2020-02-04    0.002454\n2020-02-05   -0.001446\n                ...   \n2024-12-24    1.399284\n2024-12-25    1.381391\n2024-12-26    1.373577\n2024-12-27    1.358839\n2024-12-30    1.355847\nName: 3.0, Length: 1283, dtype: float64, 4: date\n2020-01-30    0.007898\n2020-01-31    0.003582\n2020-02-03   -0.008103\n2020-02